# Web FSD

- Layers: `app → pages → widgets → features → shared`; import via segment `index.ts` (`@shared/ui`, not `@shared/ui/container`)
- `index.ts` exports symbols siblings consume; unused props/types stay internal
- Main slice UI: `view.tsx` + `types.ts` + `index.ts`; `ui/` only for secondary components
- `app/App.tsx` — exception, keep filename
- `interface` for props; `type` only for unions/derived types
- `ClassNameProps` from `@shared/types`; `cn()` only when merging `className` prop
- JSX: `condition && <El />`, not ternary; `onClick={handler}` without void wrapper
- No simple return types (`void`, `Promise<void>`, primitives)
- No `entities/` until entity UI state is needed; types from `@portfolio/domain/schemas`

See `skills/rules/09-web-fsd.md`.
